[{"title":"报国如乖愿归耕宁买田此欧阳公酬杜正献告老后诗也前辈名公亦有买田诗句盖寓归耕意尔岂真若今士夫为多田翁耶","author":"姜特立","text":"出仕虽无补，归耕宁买田。\n聊将报明主，庶不愧前贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37478,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"报恩","author":"姜特立","text":"报恩须烈士，拂意是忠臣。\n君看倾邪辈，哨哨似妇人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37479,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拒霜","author":"姜特立","text":"楚天寂历暮云平，何处江村落雁声。\n正是西风扫黄叶，不知春色在朱荣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37480,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村翁","author":"姜特立","text":"茅茨西日暖，翁媪自相依。\n不识鸳鸯意，双双作伴飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37481,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨诚斋作日屋名小旸谷次其韵","author":"姜特立","text":"旋规旸谷敌霜天，掩映金乌上紫烟。\n困睡不愁挥瓮肘，坐吟无复耸诗肩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37482,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沈约","author":"姜特立","text":"怀情既不尽，谥隐亦何疑。\n截舌帝其怒，在天灵可欺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37483,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纵目","author":"姜特立","text":"纵目郊原乱絮飞，好风娇叶弄天机。\n白滩半露溪新瘦，绿树初圆山正肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37484,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芡实","author":"姜特立","text":"芡实遍芳塘，明珠截锦囊。\n风流熏麝气，包裹借荷香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37485,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赤松三咏 其三 二仙庙","author":"姜特立","text":"自从兄弟得神仙，一去空山竟杳然。\n唯有华阴舒道士，好诗长与此山传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37486,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赤松三咏 其二 小桃源","author":"姜特立","text":"四山古木老烟云，流水桃花几换春。\n举世但誇羊化石，那知不有武陵人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37487,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赤松三咏 其一 赤松山","author":"姜特立","text":"仙山名字几千秋，勇退曾闻汉故侯。\n自笑功名无尺寸，归来也作赤松游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37488,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"足弱","author":"姜特立","text":"足弱老态增，颠仆人共骇。\n无趾真吾师，天刑乌可解。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37489,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"足弱二首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"脚力虽云弱，心灵尚宛然。\n休轻刖孙膑，犹解杀庞涓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37490,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"足弱二首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"八十颓龄血气微，杖而后起固其宜。\n尧夫有句君听取，脚力衰时药不医。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37491,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邸报京丞相薨背","author":"姜特立","text":"丞相今朝薨相位，衣冠赠典一番新。\n作场好梦归乡去，仰羡无非梦里人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37492,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"里中驱傩","author":"姜特立","text":"大傩存古礼，彩发映雕冠。\n如今身老大，不似小时看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37493,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闰七夕","author":"姜特立","text":"此夕从来天上少，斜河休问夜何其。\n不须更恨欢娱短，已是人间十日期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37494,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闰七夕呈谯内知舍人","author":"姜特立","text":"佳期有尽情无尽，一再相逢意若何。\n正使长年成会合，临分依旧黯情多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37495,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒兴","author":"姜特立","text":"数点青峰照夕晖，一湾寒碧带疏篱。\n兴来倚杖閒临眺，巾影攲风似阿谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37496,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒吟","author":"姜特立","text":"老去无心思世事，静中有业爱閒吟。\n有时看水看山处，举世何人会此心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37497,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒吟","author":"姜特立","text":"天公靳惜是虚名，怪我吟诗笔不停。\n莫把文章觑天巧，只将浑沌养馀龄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37498,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒咏二首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"翠麓青秧带小川，无营门巷自萧然。\n中间至乐何人解，只在藤床拄杖前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37499,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒咏二首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"手植山松二十年，只今翠色已藏烟。\n百年未尽终当见，雾鬣风髯上拂天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37500,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒咏三首 其三","author":"姜特立","text":"醒心亭下弄潺湲，雅志堂前拥髻鬟。\n除却华山陈处士，祇今谁似此翁閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37501,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒咏三首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"铜山鼓铸成何用，金谷荣华毕竟空。\n老子百年无长物，只留明月与清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37502,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒咏三首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"莫笑归耕计未然，我今得计是归田。\n天公若也怜衰晚，更乞閒身二十年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37503,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒赋","author":"姜特立","text":"人生浮脆若风烟，障簏操筹亦可怜。\n但得樽中长有酒，不须身后更留钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37504,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮酒","author":"姜特立","text":"平生嗜酒不耽酒，不爱深斟爱浅斟。\n嵇阮讵能知此味，可怜一世只醺沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37505,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸡伏鹜","author":"姜特立","text":"水游陆走不同生，濡足相随有至情。\n早晚拍浮春浪去，岂知垂翅到天明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37506,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"使北二首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"略无险阻蔽皇居，底事当时醉寐如。\n若使贾生参国论，便应咽死更无书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37507,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"使北二首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"万里持哀使北荒，偶能成礼报君王。\n中原旧事成新恨，添得归来两鬓霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37508,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侧金盏","author":"姜特立","text":"浅浅娇黄向日开，枝头斜挂几金杯。\n细详名字并花意，不醉花间不得回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37509,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和乐天为张建封侍儿盼盼作仍继五篇 其三","author":"姜特立","text":"黄金不惜买蛾眉，拣得如花四五枝。\n日月其除岁云暮，诗人此意报君知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37510,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和乐天为张建封侍儿盼盼作仍继五篇 其四","author":"姜特立","text":"黄金不惜买蛾眉，拣得如花四五枝。\n池堑台倾何足怪，雍门弹处不须悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37511,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和乐天为张建封侍儿盼盼作仍继五篇 其五","author":"姜特立","text":"黄金不惜买蛾眉，拣得如花四五枝。\n可笑曹瞒空狡狯，西陵作伎一何痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37512,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和乐天为张建封侍儿盼盼作仍继五篇 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"黄金不惜买蛾眉，拣得如花四五枝。\n撒手行时无挂碍，更无一物可相随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37513,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和乐天为张建封侍儿盼盼作仍继五篇 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"黄金不惜买蛾眉，拣得如花四五枝。\n遇有酒时须饮酒，得吟诗处且吟诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37514,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和叶枢相送芍药 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"暮龄携挈特东归，红药翻阶正得时。\n不是花容相妩媚，风流要索两翁诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37515,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和巩宰送牡丹三首 其三","author":"姜特立","text":"品格高低各自春，大如玉斗满如轮。\n前贤曾谱花王说，唯有姚黄始是真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37516,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和巩宰送牡丹三首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"唐世花名寖显时，才如韩白尚无诗。\n本朝盛赏唯西雒，万幄千庖泣玉脂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37517,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和巩宰送牡丹三首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"香泥筠笼远擎来，曾向河阳县里开。\n堪笑杜陵何短拙，却凭萧八觅桃栽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37518,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和巩教授访别二首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"酒醨情恶不成醺，况复匆匆欲语分。\n留客恨轮无四角，供庖叹鳖少双裙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37519,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和巩教授访别二首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"君来别我还归去，君去重来定几时。\n此后相思无可寄，相思欲寄莫如诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37520,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和弟邦佐邦达贺得节 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"吾祖平生学苦空，至今馀庆尚重重。\n佳城气象年来别，秀出南屏第一峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37521,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和弟邦佐邦达贺得节 其三","author":"姜特立","text":"平生画虎半成空，岁晚归来好事重。\n屈指燎黄应不远，金冠章绂看驼峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37522,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和弟邦佐邦达贺得节 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"初出乡关叹屡空，行人愁见暮云重。\n倦投山馆怜吾足，踏遍千峰与万峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37523,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其十","author":"姜特立","text":"夕寒山水閟清晖，归到华堂月半扉。\n倾倒锦囊无剩语，风光那得更相违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37524,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其三","author":"姜特立","text":"湖边柳色媚清涟，湖上新荷叠绮钱。\n料得高人初出郭，眼中风物一醒然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37525,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其六","author":"姜特立","text":"宝叔祠前落照红，平湖万顷碧涵空。\n个中有景君能道，添入三贤诗句中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37526,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其七","author":"姜特立","text":"群彦俱堪议相毡，小诗聊尔出秾纤。\n梅山老子何多幸，收得连珠归玉奁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37527,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其五","author":"姜特立","text":"休日吟边引兴长，岂容簿领更相妨。\n怪君诗思如河决，曾梦西江水涤肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37528,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"曾访高人旧隐居，诗情平澹宦情疏。\n缇屏今日虽泥轼，芸阁它时合校书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37529,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其八","author":"姜特立","text":"尽将丘壑捲胸中，醉帽归时御晚风。\n明日府公催吏牍，可堪骑马踏香红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37530,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其四","author":"姜特立","text":"仙山那许世人来，有底今朝洞户开。\n青鸟想传佳客至，不须惊汝问莓苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37531,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张倅湖上十绝 其九","author":"姜特立","text":"两山胜处古坟多，多少英贤发咏歌。\n它日浮家钓清濑，腰章吾欲换渔蓑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37532,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陆郎中送出关 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"得失乘除谁使然，兹行犹作赤城仙。\n支风给雨元无禁，借竹判花不费钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37533,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陆郎中送出关 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"黄尘乌帽六年间，心迹何尝一日閒。\n今日船头忽东转，始知有味是家山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37534,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和荆公二首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"子房不愿萧曹位，底事穰侯畏客来。\n得一老兵皆可饮，何须车马便惊猜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37535,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和荆公二首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"老去生涯华子冈，年来得失一绳床。\n是非尧桀何须较，身世于今更两忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37536,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和徐判院见惠诗篇 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"姚魏谁教混草莱，今朝老眼为君开。\n建安自有亲衣钵，知道诗翁不姓梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37537,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和徐判院见惠诗篇 其三","author":"姜特立","text":"新诗赠我绕朝鞭，敌手相逢一怃然。\n迦叶见花吾未解，灵均此秘子能传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37538,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和徐判院见惠诗篇 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"细知诗律析秋毫，况是天然笔力高。\n便好铺张清庙颂，不须追逐楚人骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37539,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和徐判院见惠诗篇 其四","author":"姜特立","text":"吊往文高古战场，丽天星斗射寒芒。\n也知深夺曹刘气，不用浓熏班马香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37540,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和虞守钓台四首 其四","author":"姜特立","text":"先生蝉蜕出尘埃，万古声名一草莱。\n尽道高风激贪懦，何人到此挽舟回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37541,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和虞守钓台四首 其三","author":"姜特立","text":"天下清名属至公，当时四七谩英雄。\n祠庭千古增轮奂，不见云台续画工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37542,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和虞守钓台四首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"龙衮羊裘孰重轻，当时俱是一书生。\n相忘道术仍忘势，超出人间万古情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37543,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和虞守钓台四首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"七里滩头岁月增，汉家川谷几丘陵。\n祠堂只许玄英配，此后寥寥见未曾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37544,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和虞守感秋二首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"家音何用寄，邮置有沉浮。\n旦夕天边去，书来一雁秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37545,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和虞守感秋二首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"莫忆鲈鱼美，吴天浪正浮。\n只应归梦到，千顷荻花秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37546,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅新溪七首 其七","author":"姜特立","text":"我来久矣了穷通，出处谁能与众同。\n此去便须专一壑，人生何必作三公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37547,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅新溪七首 其六","author":"姜特立","text":"如君方此富春秋，未可追寻三径游。\n且放子真归谷口，不应马援困壶头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37548,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅新溪七首 其五","author":"姜特立","text":"溪头风月四时新，机尽还欣乌鸟亲。\n沮溺相逢如借问，报言老子自知津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37549,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅新溪七首 其四","author":"姜特立","text":"钓月亭边三两家，月明无处认芦花。\n忽闻鹎鵊相惊起，知有溪禽在浅沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37550,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅新溪七首 其三","author":"姜特立","text":"浓淡燕脂千树开，崇光香雾袭人来。\n如今不共梅花笑，步绕行吟日几回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37551,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅新溪七首 其二","author":"姜特立","text":"平湖潋滟带垂杨，绿暗长堤五月凉。\n綵女移舟莲浦去，棹歌声里水风香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37552,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅新溪七首 其一","author":"姜特立","text":"山色湖光相接连，千章古木老云烟。\n晚来曲港回舟处，如在孤山柳屿边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37553,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏閒","author":"姜特立","text":"一年閒有十年功，十岁如将百岁同。\n此去得閒犹未已，向前日月尽壶中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37554,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜半","author":"姜特立","text":"夜半霜铺瓦，浑如水泼衾。\n炉红朝易起，衣重老难任。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37555,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜永","author":"姜特立","text":"夜永醉还醒，邻鸡已有声。\n衾寒霜令急，木落睡魂清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37556,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]